  "description": "A custom Sitecore Content Editor field that lets pick a color via a native browser\n      color picker or by typing a hex value directly, with optional swatch palettes and optional\n      transparency (8-digit #RRGGBBAA) support. Supports Sitecore XP 10.1+.",
